===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|hematology|cytology}} A small colorless disk-shaped particle found in the blood of [[mammal]]s, which plays an important role in the formation of [[blood clot]]s.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|blood platelet}}
* {{l|en|thrombocyte}}

